{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01225","headline":"相和歌辞  相逢行 · 崔颢","name":"相和歌辞  相逢行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾年初二八，家住洛桥头。\n玉户临驰道，朱门近御沟。\n使君何假问，夫壻大长秋。\n女弟新承宠，诸兄近拜侯。\n春生百子殿，花发五城楼。\n出入千门里，年年乐未休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01225.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01225","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}